---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 — 页面不存在 · openclaude"
  description="你要找的页面不存在。"
>
  <section class="nf grid-bg">
    <div class="container nf-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">// 404</p>
      <h1 class="text-hero">页面不存在。</h1>
      <p class="text-body-dim">这个页面没有找到；这一次大概不是 agent 能自动修好的那种问题。</p>
      <div class="nf-links">
        <a class="button button-ghost" href="/">← 返回首页</a>
        <a class="button button-ghost" href="/docs/">浏览文档</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .nf { padding: calc(var(--nav-h) + 8rem) 0 8rem; }
  .nf-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .nf-links { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
</style>
